Z||000003||Slammed Fiero||05-10-2001||11:42 PM||||My car is lowered , I can not fit a coke can under the side of it. There is a street in my town with a bunch of warehouses, when they unload transports block the street, I just drive under them , clears just fine. Same with the toll gates at school , the parking guy doesn't like when I fly under them without tapping the brakes (haha).<P>It's a pain on speedbumps , or even streets with slight dips in the pavement. steep driveways (forget it) , But it just handles and looks soo damm cool , Kids with lowered civics look like monster trucks!!<P><BR> <P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
