Z||000008||JSocha||05-11-2001||09:52 AM||||When I bought mine last November, I drove it back from Hutchinson, MN while the wife drove our Dodge 1-ton back.  I really didn't realize just how much dirt my inner fender wells on the dually really collect until then!<P>I'm just glad that little Fiero isn't like most vehicles on the road in MN, where they are rusted out front to back, top to bottom.  Otherwise, I may have found out just how low to the ground they are.<P>Scrape...Ouch!...Ooooowwccchhh!...OWWWWW! D#mn it!  OWWWWWWWWWWWWW! &lt;Road Rash&gt;<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha.jpg"> ||||reg||1
