Z||000040||Steve Normington||05-15-2001||12:27 AM||||How low is a Fiero?<P>It's lower than a 68 Jaguar E-type (Dad's toy).<P>Getting out of a Fiero is a cake walk compared to the Jag. The knee part of the driver's seat never moves behind the steering wheel, leaving about 6 - 8 inches gap. If you lever yourself out using the steering wheel, you'll snap the wheel off. The only way to get in is to stand on the seat and lower yourself straight down. I don't how the hardtop guys do it.||||reg||6
