Z||000042||Ken Wittlief||05-15-2001||11:51 AM||||Hey its an energy savings feature. You can adjust your garage door opener so it only goes up 4 feet, and still pull your car though.<P>  If everyone in california had fieros and did this on their garage door openers it would save 3.7 million KHW per day, enough to end the rolling blackouts and restore peace and tranquillity to the west coast.<P>  Going over bridges and cant see? set the cruise control and sit up on the center console (or stand up though the sunroof).||||reg||1
